@startuml
title Serial / Parallel GC：单轮 GC 与自适应反馈状态机
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide empty description

state "正常分配\nbump + TLAB" as Alloc
state "Eden 耗尽\n(TLAB 重填失败且 Eden 无空间)" as EdenFull
state "Minor GC (STW)\n扫根 + 扫脏卡 + 复制" as Minor
state "复制 / 晋升\n活对象 → To-space 或 Old" as Promote
state "Survivor 是否放得下？" as SurvivorCheck
state "晋升失败 Promotion Failure\n(老年代无空间容纳)" as Fail
state "老年代压力\n(晋升/大对象直接分配)" as OldPressure
state "Full GC (STW)\n标记-整理 LISP2" as Full
state "自适应调整\n(UseAdaptiveSizePolicy)\nEden/Survivor/晋升阈值" as Adapt

[*] --> Alloc
Alloc --> EdenFull : 分配指针触顶
EdenFull --> Minor : 触发
Minor --> Promote : 暂停所有 Mutator
Promote --> SurvivorCheck : 复制完成
SurvivorCheck --> Alloc : 放得下\n(恢复运行)
SurvivorCheck --> Full : 放不下 / 晋升失败
OldPressure --> Full : 老年代分配失败\n或达到触发阈值
Fail --> Full : 回退
Full --> Adapt : 压缩完成，统计停顿/吞吐
Adapt --> Alloc : 调整后代大小后恢复分配
Promote --> OldPressure : 对象晋升
OldPressure --> Alloc : 仍有空间

note right of Minor
  单线程 = Serial（DefNew）
  多线程 = Parallel Scavenge
  算法本身相同，只是复制并行化
end note

note bottom of Full
  Minor GC 与 Full GC 都是 STW；
  Serial Old 单线程整理，
  Parallel Old 把四个阶段并行化。
end note
@enduml
